{"book":"daxue","id":"sishu.daxue.02","index":2,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.02.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"type":"text","value":"《"},{"pinyin":"kāng","traditional":"康","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诰","pinyin":"gào","traditional":"誥","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"》"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"kè","traditional":"克","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kanggao (Khong-koo) (salah satu bab kitab Kerajaan Zhou - Ciu) tertulis, \"Tekunlah di dalam Kebajikan Yang Bercahaya itu\" (Shu Jing - Su King V.9.1)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.02.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"type":"text","value":"《"},{"pinyin":"tài","traditional":"太","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiǎ","traditional":"甲","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"》"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"modern":"顾","pinyin":"gù","traditional":"顧","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"𬤊","pinyin":"shì","traditional":"諟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mìng","traditional":"命","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Taijia (Thai Kak) (salah satu bab kitab kerajaan Siang) tertulis, \"Pandang dan camkanlah Firman Tuhan Yang Gemilang itu.\" (Shu Jing - Su King IV. 5A. 2)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.02.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"type":"text","value":"《"},{"pinyin":"dì","traditional":"帝","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"diǎn","traditional":"典","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"》"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"kè","traditional":"克","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jùn","traditional":"峻","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Hikayat bagian Raja Yao (Giau) tertulis, \"Camkan benar-benar Kebajikan Yang Bercahaya Lagi Mulia itu\" (Shu Jing - Su King I.1.2)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.02.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"jiē","traditional":"皆","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Sesungguhnya untuk memperoleh Kegemilangan itu hanya tergantung pada usaha orang itu sendiri."}],"source_file":"01 - Da Xue 大學/02 - Bab I - Kebajikan Yang Bercahaya.md","title":"Bab I — Kebajikan Yang Bercahaya"}
